    "sections": [
      {
        "label": "1st period",
        "score": "BOS 3, FLA 1",
        "text": "Nikita Zadorov fought Brady Tkachuk off the opening faceoff. Lindholm's shot off Jacob Markstrom at 4:50 was ruled no goal, then counted on review, and Eyssimont poked in a loose puck at 6:11 in his season debut for 2–0. Geekie's one-timer on a 5-on-3 made it 3–0, his goal in a fourth straight game, before Carter Verhaeghe scored on a power play. Swayman made 17 saves in the period."
      },
      {
        "label": "2nd period",
        "score": "BOS 3, FLA 1",
        "text": "No goals. Charlie McAvoy was checked for a concussion after a late hit but was cleared for the third. Four 10-minute misconducts were handed out in eight seconds at the end of the period, including to Zadorov and Hampus Lindholm, leaving Boston with four defensemen for half the third."
      },
      {
        "label": "3rd period",
        "score": "Final: BOS 4, FLA 1",
        "text": "JJ Peterka scored 58 seconds in, set up by David Pastrnak, for 4–1. The game finished with 126 penalty minutes and seven misconducts."
      }
    ],
